kN3w0KRN8l8;;;Snow halation - Love Live! School idol festival;;;https://siivagunner.fandom.com/wiki/Snow%20halation%20-%20Love%20Live!%20School%20idol%20festival ;;;Crocodile Rock - Elton John from Gnomeo & Juliet. Instead of the thumbnail, the rip begins with footage of μ's performing "Snow halation" from the Love Live! episode "Melody of the Heart". At 0:10, footage from the scene in Gnomeo & Juliet in which "Crocodile Rock" plays is superimposed over the Love Live! footage, transitioning into unedited footage from the scene. At 0:37, the "Cool Transition" text used in =3 is briefly superimposed over the footage to transition to the next part of the rip. From 0:38 to 0:57, the video shows several references to Season 7 events and memes in rapid succession. This section of the video acts as a send-off to Season 7, due to this being the last regular rip of the season (being followed by "One Last Chance", its soundtrack, and "...of Season 7"). Animated snow is displayed over this entire section (except for the last one, which already had snow).  At 0:38, Rodrigo Barão and Nozomi Toujou from the rip "Créditos - Toca Pisadinha", referencing The Pisadinhover, with IShowSpeed's infamous "Showing the Meat" stream playing in the background, referencing both "I Show The Meat" being introduced as a meme during the season and the Five Nights at Freddy's 3 8th Anniversary event. At 0:39, a clip of Luigi from "Super Mario Dance Bros" by JoeldinhoNoEnemies, referencing The Day of Luigi. At 0:41, horizontally-flipping footage from "Ruby Illusions - Final Boss (In-Game Version) (Beta Mix) - Sonic Mania", referencing April Fools' Day 2023. At 0:42, an image of Tito Dick over a clip of Patty Martin from Lucky Star, referencing Dick's Retribution and the Saidai Seichi Challenge, with a gif of circling birds appearing over Patty's head, referencing National Go Birding Day. At 0:44, an unknown video of an Opila Bird chase in a Garten of Banban-themed Minecraft mod, referencing the Garten of Banban 3, Garten of Banban 4, and Garten of Banban 6 events. At 0:46, Bottom G dancing from "Bumble Bee Dance #BOTTOMG #BrianMichaelHinds" by Brian Michael Hinds over the "Raft Ride" minigame and gameplay footage of Densha de GO!!, referencing the rip "Poem Panic - Tate's Journey" and the events "Raft Ride" Day and Densha de GO!! Day respectively. At 0:47, a clip of the South Park episode "Goth Kids 3: Dawn of the Posers" of goth characters on a school bus, referencing World Goth Day and South Park Day. At 0:48, a clip of the video "A SUPER Big Announcement", referencing National Go Fishing Day 2023. At 0:50, it cuts to the banner used for Bootleg Day, followed by the normal banner with PSY dancing on top of it, referencing PSY Day 8. At 0:51, the banner used for Barbie Day. At 0:52, the various banners used for Whip and Nae Nae Day Day (Part 2). At 0:53, the banner used for the ROBLOX 17th Anniversary, followed by the banner used for  the "What Makes You Beautiful" 12th Anniversary. At 0:54, sped up footage of "The Protegent Rap", referencing The SiIvaGunner Halloween Horror Special Part VI: The Cult of Proto. At 0:55, the video "Ryu from Streets™" by erarg, referencing Street Fighter Day. At 0:56, the music video for "Goomba Got Back", referencing "Goomba Got Back" Day. At 0:57, an unknown gif of workers in a factory, referencing Industrial Ripvolution. At 0:59, gameplay footage of a race starting on Frappe Snowland in Mario Kart 64, referencing the frequent ripping of "Frappe Snowland" during the return of The SilvaGunner Christmas Comeback Crisis. From 1:00 to 1:01, four gnome-related images are shown in succession:  A meme of David the Gnome with the text "HOW ABOUT I"/"SLAP YOUR SHIT". The "Slayer" meme image. Steve the gnome puking rainbows from the Gravity Falls episode "Tourist Trapped". The SoundCloud icon for "THE DJ KILLER KEEMSTAR ALBUM" by DJ Keemstar, referencing a meme about Keemstar being a gnome that originated with the Content Cop episode on