1EcVibil02Q;;;Christmas Pain in Christmas Town (feat. Dave Pino) - Hypnospace Outlaw;;;https://siivagunner.fandom.com/wiki/Christmas%20Pain%20in%20Christmas%20Town%20(feat.%20Dave%20Pino)%20-%20Hypnospace%20Outlaw ;;;Much like with the rips "SquisherZ (Aud2hsm Converter Trial) - Hypnospace Outlaw", "Awesome Rap Beat - Hypnospace Outlaw", and "Tension - Hypnospace Outlaw", this rip shows footage of a page made using the Hypnospace Productivity Suite, a page builder and music creator for Hypnospace Outlaw. The date on HypnOS' startup screen has been changed to "November 6, 1999 1-G02-234". The enforcer's desktop has the following details:  The desktop uses one of the Gray's Peak Cola Co. official Coolpunk wallpapers. Several files and applications, including HYPII's file and the SCG Soundscape Generator application, are placed around the desktop. The HSPD Enforcer Dashboard app is placed right above the right eye of the Shakespear statue sticker, referencing SiIvaGunner's eyepatch. Various stickers from the "Terry's General Store" page, specifically the "TERRYS HALLOWEEN STICKERS" pack and the stickers from the "Terry Sticker s" page, are scattered around the desktop. Seven SquisherZ stickers are also scattered around the desktop, specifically Leaka, Barfly, Oozurf, Gloyo, Mushi, Shellslop, and Hissslime. The enforcer's mouse trail is set to high and uses the "SquisherZ" sound effect from the SquisherZ Quest game. The enforcer's name is "smol". smol visits the "Coolpunk Paradise" zone and selects a page titled "Xmas Pain in Xmas Town", with the description "Music: Christmas Pain in Christmas Town/Composer: Chowder Man/Platform: HypnOS" in reference to the standard video description. The link takes smol to a Hypnospace Outlaw-style website based around "Snow halation", with the following details:  The URL of the website is "XMASPAIN", and the title of the page is "Xmas Pain in Xmas Town". The page has the snowflake trailing cursor used throughout "Coolpunk Paradise". The page plays a mashup of the advertised track and "Snow halation". The advertised track is pitch-shifted to "Snow halation" at 2:14 and 5:13. The background is of the stage that µ's perform "Snow halation" on. The top of the page has gifs of Smol Nozomi and Smol Honoka and two spinning stars, with animated text reading "Snow halation/"Christian" Rock and Roll?" in a style based on the text style from SHERRIHEALS and LOOKOUTMINISTRIES's page. Underneath are the boombox gif from the SquisherZ Quest game page, the microphone gif, and ARLAN_FER_OBBEE's "WITW Earl" Noble Smiley, as well as the text "vvv Sing along!! vvv", scrolling lyrics of "Snow halation", and HS_Music and HS_JoemanStreetTeam badges. smol scrolls all the way down until the stage is shown, redirecting to a similar page based on character-dedicated "Snow halation" rips with the URL "SNOWHALATION" and the title "Snow Halation". The page has the same image of the stage, but adds an image of The Chowder Man from the advertised track's music video on the right-hand side. At 0:55, smol moves the mouse so that the trailing cursor creates "snowfall". At 1:32, the page is reloaded to add animated snowfall to the background. At 2:30, a gif of Smol Nozomi appears on the stage. At 4:07, smol scrolls up to the top of the page, revealing a tableau of the following gifs and images that reflects the downfall of Coolpunk in the game:  Three tombstones in the foreground. The header illustration of Joeman drinking from X_NEO_ICY_X's "COOLPUNK PARADISE: OUR HOME" page, with the laughing skull gif used in "Linda's Horror Page" over his head. The "COOL" snowman gif originating from IcicleKid's page. A gif of Joeman originating from the "COOLFEST '99" page. The title gif from the "COOLPUNK IS DEAD" page over a spiral gif. In addition, various samples of other Coolpunk songs from the game are added to the mashup:    Time  Joke   4:07  "X-MAZ Medley (Coolpunk)" ("ho" and bell samples)   4:12, 4:21  "Chill It Right (Fre3zer)" ("R-R-Rhyme!" and "C'mon C'mon!" samples)   4:21  "Gotta Gotta" ("Gotta" sample)   4:34  "MxMaZZZZ" ("Merry Christmas!" sample)  At 4:28, smol scrolls back down to the stage. At 4:34, the stage turns yellow as in the original performance of "Snow halation", as gifs of all members of μ's in the style of Smol Nozomi appear on the stage, mostly in the same order as the original performance of "Snow halation", with The Chowder Man being slightly moved to the right. At the same time, the vocals of "Snow halation" are added in.  At 5:49, smol scrolls up once more to a flickering gif of Gumshoe Gooper playing the saxophone from AbbyWrites58's "Sandy 4 Leader!" page in the sky. At 6:00, smol decides to log off of HypnOS, ending the rip;;;Kamayana
