at are still in the source code. You might want to check out. Softendo: I will take a look at fan game right now.  Softendo moves from the laptop.  Softendo: Maybe something isn't spelled incorrectly.   It then shows the credits that the mystery voice was referring to. At 3:37, it zooms in on the credits where "Michal (Buziol) Gdaniec is shown.   Softendo: Hmm... Skell... That is... a quite familiar name. ...the graphics of this cut scean is not enhanced still... Softendo(?): ...things were simpler back then... ...what is going on with me right now... a few things are starting to come back to me...  The "By Buziol Games 2003" logo from the credits appears as the Softendo logo is visible.  The World 8 music starts playing  Buziol(?): ...what have I become? no no no no, I must... I must stop myself from becoming this. ???: Boss, where are you going? Buziol(?): I need to stop myself. Softendo: Famyly Guy Mario Game Online Download Free Mario Fan Games Mario...  The voice speeds up before it is interrupted by a shotgun soundeffect.  Buziol: This cannot go on forever... It must be stopped.   At 4:45, it goes back to the same credits with the "The end" text being shown;;;LuNiney
