pZQVScRXg48;;;Gusty Garden Galaxy (Extende Version) - Super Mario Galaxy;;;https://siivagunner.fandom.com/wiki/Gusty%20Garden%20Galaxy%20(Extende%20Version)%20-%20Super%20Mario%20Galaxy ;;;Instead of using the original advertised track, the rip uses a GXSCC midislap of the advertised track, using a MIDI by Blue.Nocturne. Starting at 0:09, the melody is also changed to several songs:    Time  Joke  Source   0:09, 0:34  "Snow halation"  Love Live!   0:20, 0:46  "Smooth"  Santana ft. Rob Thomas   1:00  "The Noble Haltmann"  Kirby Planet Robobot   1:24  "GO MY WAY!!"  THE iDOLM@STER  At 1:57, the track loops with the jokes repeating each time. It continuously loops for 30 minutes and fades out at 29:45. The overall joke with the use of a GXSCC midislap, the length, and mix name are references to "Gusty Garden Galaxy (not really 8-bit but a MIDI played in GXSCC) - Super Mario Galaxy Music Extende" from the (since terminated) YouTube channel BrawlBRSTMs3 X, that uploaded an extended version of a Famitracker cover of "Gusty Garden Galaxy", incorrectly titling it as a GXSCC midislap. The "d" in "Extended" being cutoff is due to the YouTube's title length limit. Additionally, the composer credits include Blue.Nocturne;;;trivial171
