XaXxs0ZvDlc;;;File Select Fusion;;;https://siivagunner.fandom.com/wiki/File%20Select%20Fusion ;;;File Select - Super Mario 64, which the advertised track is a remix of, hence why it was included.   Anyway, since we've explained what a half A rip is, now it's time to build up some memes. And I mean a lot of memes, by using a trick called... "high quality ripping." Now, you're probably wondering what I'm gonna need all these memes for. After all, I do build up memes for 9 months. But to answer that, we need to crank back 3 times.  Now, post-universes aren't as stylish as you might think, as they have no memes, like the Nutshack, or "Snow halation", no "Gangnam Style", no mashups like Chip or "All Star", and not even any GRAND DAD. But, this is a necessary step into ripping every last music track... AND REACHING THE STARS.   The speech itself references how there had been 9 months between this rip and the first rip. It also mentions "Crank That", The Nutshack, "Snow halation", "Gangnam Style", Chip tha Ripper, "All Star", and 7 GRAND DAD ("All Star" being the only one of these memes to be otherwise absent from the rip). At 3:57, the lyrics of "DK Rap" are sentence mixed into the following lyrics:   So it's finally over, no more memes. If you know they're memes you can follow your dreams! Put your hands together, this channel was funny. His Coconut Gun can fire in spurts. HUH! GS, GiIvasunner! SG, SiIvagunner! CG, Coconut Gun!   At 4:17, Joel gives several reactions in the style of his reaction to 7 GRAND DAD:   GRAND MA! SEEMPSONS!? GRAND SON! JETSONS!? GRAND PA! FAMILY GUY!? Funny moments.  STANKY MAYMAYS! SILVAGUNNER!? GRAND DAD! FLEENTSTONES!?     Time  Joke  Source  Ripper   0:00  Joel introducing the rip  Vinesauce Joel     0:06  "Title Theme & Ending"  7 GRAND DAD     "Unknown from M.E."  Sonic Adventure 2     "30 Hours"  Kanye West     0:43  "In the Air Tonight" (drum break)  Phil Collins     0:45  "Bird Up!"  The Eric Andre Show     0:46  "Intro"  Scott Pilgrim